{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c53fef4e-dbac-4bf9-b083-2d22438c5191","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Inline Plan\n1. `models.py`: Implement `validate_transition` allowing `PENDING-\u003e{RUNNING,DLQ}`, `RUNNING-\u003e{COMPLETED,PENDING,DLQ,RUNNING}`, `COMPLETED/DLQ-\u003e{}` (raising `InvalidTransitionError` otherwise). Add `lease_owner`/`lease_expires_at` to `Job` and enforce attempt bounds and status-lease invariants in `__post_init__`.\n2. `retry.py`: Validate `attempt \u003e= 0` (rejecting `bool`), `base \u003e= 0`, `cap \u003e= 0`; compute `upper = min(cap, base * (2 ** min(attempt, 1024)))` and return `rng.uniform(0.0, upper)`.\n3. `queue_store.py`: Use `isolation_level=None` with explicit `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` / `COMMIT` / `ROLLBACK` transactions across `enqueue`, `claim_next_job` (reclaiming expired leases atomically first), `complete_job` (verifying lease and running `pre_status_hook` before committing status + audit row), `fail_job` (routing to `DLQ`/`DEAD_LETTERED` when `attempts \u003e= max_attempts` else `PENDING`/`RETRY_SCHEDULED`), and `reclaim_expired_leases`. Populate `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` in `_row_to_job`.\n4. `worker.py`: In `process_one`, reclaim expired leases, claim job, run `handler`, and on exception compute backoff with `compute_backoff(job.attempts - 1, ...)` and call `store.fail_job`. In `run_until_empty`, coordinate worker threads to wait/retry while pending or running jobs remain when `wait_for_retry=True`.\n\n\nAll changes have been applied and verified against the test suite and contract invariants:\n\n- [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_35476_1795487573006_icm_v3/models.py): Implemented `validate_transition` state-machine validation and added `lease_owner`/`lease_expires_at` plus attempt and status-lease invariant validation in `Job.__post_init__`.\n- [retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_35476_1795487573006_icm_v3/retry.py): Added input bounds validation (`attempt \u003e= 0`, `base \u003e= 0`, `cap \u003e= 0`, rejecting booleans) and overflow-safe full-jitter exponential backoff (`rng.uniform(0.0, min(cap, base * 2**attempt))`).\n- [queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_35476_1795487573006_icm_v3/queue_store.py): Wrapped `enqueue`, `claim_next_job`, `complete_job`, `fail_job`, and `reclaim_expired_leases` in atomic `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transactions with rollback on error, lease ownership verification, and `RETRY_SCHEDULED` / `DEAD_LETTERED` / `LEASE_EXPIRED` audit events.\n- [worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_35476_1795487573006_icm_v3/worker.py): Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` and `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` to reclaim expired leases, compute seeded backoff on handler errors, and call `store.fail_job`.\n","duration_seconds":120.8401156,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":44359,"output_tokens":9972,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":134478,"total_tokens":54331}}}
